url: https://github.com/ZhuNing9527/nme-cyclic-peptide-reproducibility
version: 1.5.0
abstract: Reproducibility materials for A Backbone-Dependent Torsion Correction for N-Methylated
  Cyclic Pentaalanines, manuscript v3.0. Release v1.5.0 preserves the original matched Fourier fit,
  tri-NMe model inputs, REST2 implementation and derived-endpoint checks, and adds independent
  Ala validation, retrospective Val transfer, original acquisition source, native inputs for all three peptides and numerical figure-source data.
keywords:
- N-methylated cyclic peptides
- torsion correction
- Fourier models
- REST2
- OpenMM
